3.Problem Description

Three arrays contain the names of students enrolled in different subjects: Computer, Science, and Maths.

Your task is to determine:

Students enrolled in exactly one subject
Students enrolled in exactly two subjects
Students enrolled in all three subjects

Print the names category-wise.
Input: Three string arrays representing student names in:
Computer
Science
Maths
Output Print:
Students studying only one subject
Students studying exactly two subjects
Students studying all three subjects

